                    coach_default:          `Decision logged.`,
                    coach_r1_need_right:    `<strong>That's the outcome NorthGrid is actually buying.</strong> Behaviour change is what the CHRO sponsor will judge the renewal on — leaders running a decarbonised business differently, not a topic list. Now you can design toward a measurable outcome instead of an elegant agenda nobody renews.`,
