                    coach_r1_partial:       `<strong>That serves one stakeholder, not the buyer.</strong> Reskilling pleases the divisional MDs and an asset pleases HR, but the renewal is judged on the behaviour change the CHRO sponsor is buying. Lead with the outcome the decision-buyer cares about.`,
